Dialogue: 8,0:11:07.37,0:11:10.94,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}私も一生懸命やるので よろしくお願いします
Dialogue: 9,0:11:11.43,0:11:13.17,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}哦 請多指教
Dialogue: 8,0:11:11.43,0:11:13.17,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}お おう よろしく…
